      "bookIndex": 17,
      "hadithIndex": 2845,
      "bookHadithIndex": 2,
      "text": "Narrated Abdullah ibn Mughaffal: The Prophet (ﷺ) said: Were dogs not a species of creature I should command that they all be killed; but kill every pure black one",
